# 订阅数据库原始导出（WoS / Scopus / Embase / CNKI / 万方）不得入库：Clarivate、Elsevier、CNKI 条款
# Raw exports from subscription databases must never be committed; publish IDs + screening judgments only.
inputs/
*.ciw
savedrecs*.txt
scopus*.csv
!tests/fixtures/*
# 运行目录（API 取回的题录、摘要）默认不入库；发布时只挑选标识符与判定
runs/
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.DS_Store
*-tmp.*
